Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:33.40,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\\pos(1402,642)}A New Voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ucyuu no kanata Iskandar he unmei seoi ima tobitatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:40.77,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's about to take off to Iscandar carrying the fate of humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:47.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}We'll return for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:55.87,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Smile back at the people waving their hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:01:02.85,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:01:02.85,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:10.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:32.84,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,The Blue Crystal...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.91,0:01:36.15,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,The color of that flower is the color of sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:40.04,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Sister, have you ever considered...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:45.00,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,...giving up on your fruitless salvation efforts, \Nand opening up Sanktel instead ?{\Nopening the Sanktel instead of waiting for \Nrescue attempts that don't seem to succeed ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:48.86,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{sono}Wouldn't that bring peace to the universe ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:53.20,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Humans always fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.86,0:01:59.97,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,They can't seem to reach the same state that the creator, Archelias, had achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:05.40,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{hito}In order for humans to \Nobtain eternity as they are...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:07.13,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,...then we must rely{depend} on Sanktel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:11.17,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{desalium}That's what the Dezariam want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:15.84,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{hito}It's the only way for humans\N to be free from sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:20.95,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{ima}We still have time. \NPlease perform the ritual for Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:26.57,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Yurisha, not much time has passed\N since you became what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.42,0:02:29.93,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Once enough time passes,\N you'll understand that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:33.95,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{eien}...with eternity in its hands,\Nmankind will not achieve salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:39.44,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Eternity and happiness can never coexist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:47.88,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,You both already know that the humans \Nwho currently inhabit this universe…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:52.82,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,…were created by the intervention of the\NAncient Archelias civilization, am I correct ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:57.37,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{watakushi}We are all children of Archelias.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:02.91,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{demo}Yet time of birth, and the time necessary\Nfor us to grow and evolve differ.{But the time of birth and the time \Nrequired for evolution are different.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.91,0:03:04.84,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Our personalities are different, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:08.57,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{ningen}The same goes for human siblings.{It's just like human siblings.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.73,0:03:14.68,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,On that account, Iscandar is one of \Nthe earliest civilizations to develop...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:16.55,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,...much like the eldest son...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:22.02,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{tayumanu}...having a tireless desire to improve \Nand a thirst for knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:25.82,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{donyoku}A greedy, controlling\N and very selfish first son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:35.86,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Because of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:39.28,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...the people of Iscandar realized early that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:44.71,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{warera}...every rule of the universe would become\N an obstacle in reaching the state of...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:51.86,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{karera}…the ancient people of Archelias, who \Ncreated us and then departed elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:55.31,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Ranhalt...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:04:01.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Once you escape all physical \Nrestraints, including this body...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:03.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Keyman, is that you ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:04.71,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why are you here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:10.71,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What you're looking at is a human\Nform that both of you can recognize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:16.80,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It appears an acceptable shape\N must be chosen for the truth to be told.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:19.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:20.00,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.04,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Scared ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.51,0:04:32.95,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Right. I can't stop shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:35.91,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Every Garmillas soldier seems disturbed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:40.60,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,...ever since they heard Starsha's\Nproclamation about telling us the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:46.24,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,{sorewa}It's like their bodies are telling them\Nthat they shouldn't know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:51.37,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,{konna}Being in combat would be much better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:56.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,This is the entrance to Sanktel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:05:01.55,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,In order to proceed,\N you must undergo a ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:02.57,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Ritual ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:08.97,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The civilization of Telezart reached the same\N state as ours when they abandoned their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:12.91,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,They obtained the crystallized entity called Teresa...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:15.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...but they became isolated because\N of their intermediate existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:21.30,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The people of Iscandar are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:24.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,We preserved everything within our memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:27.60,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...and obtained the ability to \Nchange the universe with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:40.82,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,This path is normally irreversible...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:45.71,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...but in your case you'll\N only have a brief dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:03.37,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.\N Open your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:10.77,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,There are countless civilizations containing \Nthe wisdom of multitudes of intelligent lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.77,0:06:18.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{iscandar}Every element of those planets, including Iscandar,\N is stored in this gigantic memory vault called Sanktel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:25.02,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{kono}Within those crystals, a number of memories\Nremain active, living on in eternal joy.{In those crystals, a number of memories\N remain active, living in eternal happiness.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:44.66,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,You did it, Susumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:57.46,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,This male alpine black swallowtail \Nwill complete your collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:02.73,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,This butterfly can obtain eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:08.57,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,Once mounted, this butterfly\N will remain beautiful forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:14.42,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,But you know it, don't you ?\NSuch happiness won't last forever.{You know happiness doesn't last forever.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:24.35,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{subete}What if you could forget about everything\N and live in this moment forever ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.35,0:07:28.60,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{sukina}What if you could live and re-live your favorite moment as many times as you wanted ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:36.53,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,Abelt, you are an incomplete human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:39.91,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,Everyone is incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:42.37,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,That's why people kill each other, \Neven on the same planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:49.35,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,Such twisted{crooked} people are\N scattered throughout the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:55.44,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,Humans annihilate each other, and they'll\Ninevitably bring destruction upon the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:08:02.04,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,Before that happens, we can turn entire \Ncivilizations into memories for preservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:06.71,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,Just like this butterfly retains its beauty...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:10.60,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,...all living things can live in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:16.60,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{seishi}Multiple civilizations can\Ncoexist forever in static time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:20.75,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,If we use the Cosmo Reverse System...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:25.71,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,...we can even reconstruct a real\N civilization from its memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:35.91,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,That is, if we choose to abandon our eternal\Nhappiness, and venture outside once more.{That is, if we wish to go outside \Nby abandoning this eternal happiness.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:40.46,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,Now, let's begin the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:50.51,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,Don't avert your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:57.13,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,In order to store all the elements of a planet, \Nthe civilization and its people...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:09:00.55,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,...we must wipe them from the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:04.17,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,That is the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:08.62,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,It's been repeated over and over to\N preserve lives and civilizations forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:10.75,def2,ELRIC,0,0,0,,Genocide by Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:15.20,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,You must be thinking something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:17.62,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,You're correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:21.17,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,The people of Iscandar were the first\N to turn themselves into elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:26.64,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{hajime}It began with a few people. \NAnd eventually everyone followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:32.00,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{kioku}All except for the royal family, \Nwhich manages the memory vault...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:34.66,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,...the people of Iscandar\N abandoned their physical bodies...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:36.77,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{Sanktel}...and laid themselves within Sanktel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:44.66,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{daga}If so, who's performing the ritual of destroying lives and civilizations with a massive army ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:53.40,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{motome}What was needed was a strong body, as well as the\N weakness of surviving only in a specific environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:55.40,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{kanri}Such slaves are easy to manipulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:10:02.48,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{Iscandar}They must worship Iscandar as a god, \Nand follow its orders faithfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:07.00,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,Iscandar discovered a planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:11.40,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{soko}...and abducted its blue-skinned locals...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:14.44,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,{mizukara}...who were then forced to \Nmigrate to Iscandar's twin planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.57,0:10:22.55,def2,MAMORU,0,0,0,,Utilizing the Cosmo Reverse, the infertile planet was\N reborn as an identical copy of their home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:26.04,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The slaves are called...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:27.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:32.73,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,In the ancient language of Iscandar it means...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.73,0:10:34.13,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,..."Galman ape.""
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:37.84,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Grow up quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.04,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Abelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:55.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Desler !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.11,0:10:59.95,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Knowing all this,\N do you still wish to save me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:14.04,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,It's so quiet.\N It's almost creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:18.31,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Will Captain Kodai bring Starsha...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.31,0:11:20.31,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,I am certain he will bring her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:24.82,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,He isn't the kind of person \Nwho would abandon someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:39.15,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The Garmillans are slaves who were \Nbrought from Galman by Iscandar ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:43.84,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Loyalty to Iscandar and the\N pride in our noble blue skin...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:48.44,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...are just mere results of \Nmind control on the entire race.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:52.70,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The life of our planet was shortened...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:12:03.17,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{taiko}...due to the stress of turning a lifeless planet into a copy of planet Galman thousands of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:06.22,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{gamilus sei}It eroded planet Garmillas\N and hastened its death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:10.51,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,It was all to keep the \Nblue-skinned slaves in captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:14.62,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:19.88,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Iscandar closed the memory\N vault thousands of years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:22.84,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,...and stopped turning lives \Nand civilizations into elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:27.93,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,It's not because we\N realized our mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.93,0:12:34.28,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,, We indulged in reliving the happiness of\N the past and lost interest in outside worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:39.28,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{amaneku}The evolution of all living things...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.31,0:12:45.93,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{katsute}I redefined such Iscandarism,\N a relic of the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:50.35,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,...and tried to establish a new\N relationship with Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:13:00.44,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,But you sought a planet to replace the dying Garmillas, and began an inter-galactic invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:06.20,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{sore}It was the same path Iscandar went down...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:08.40,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,...which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:15.35,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...Earth became the subject of your relief, as it suffered the threat of extinction from the Garmillas invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:22.17,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,And then {\i1}you{\i0} sent information \Nabout Planet Galman to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:25.40,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Why ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:29.33,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,You once told me to grow up quickly !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:32.17,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Was it because you wanted\N to tell me the truth ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:36.04,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{watashi}Or to make me shoot you ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:45.44,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,If so, you're beyond arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:50.40,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The Queen of Iscandar giving her\None life as repentance for past sins…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.42,0:13:53.73,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...won't settle as a recompense for the\Noppression suffered by the people of Garmillas !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:04.20,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,None of my actions are for redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:08.71,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,The reason why I tried to save Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:15.11,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,...and told you about Planet Galman\Nwas simply to save myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:22.06,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,I'm a descendant of Iscandar, \Nwhich self-righteously committed tyranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:25.46,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{Sanktel}I'm also a member of the royal \Nfamily, which manages Sanktel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:33.08,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{eien}I tried to ease my pain,\N as I'm destined to live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.48,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Aren't you the same ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:45.42,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,You're trying to save me to ease the pain and suffering of losing Planet Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.35,0:14:52.04,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,You can't atone for\Nanything by doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:58.55,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,We only needed each other\Nto console ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:12.00,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,To live, means to continually change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:16.04,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,I learned that from your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:23.04,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,These collections of memories indulge themselves in happiness, and they refuse to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:26.24,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{mou}They're no different from being dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:31.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Dezariam is after the massive\N amount of knowledge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:38.31,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,These systems use the best\Nof those wave motion civilizations…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:40.91,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,...and these can be made to \Ncoalesce into a dreadful weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.77,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,We can't let them have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:48.60,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.31,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I'll surrender Iscandar...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:15:59.24,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...on one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:03.68,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Let the Garmillas\N migrant fleet escape safely...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:06.93,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...and hand it over to\N the Earth-Garmillas joint fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:11.26,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:19.44,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,I want to pay respect to your benevolence in trying to save all intelligent life forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:23.64,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Personal transmission from Captain Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:25.84,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Patch me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:31.02,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Yuki...Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:35.71,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I...I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:38.15,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...I don't know what to do any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.51,0:16:40.82,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.33,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Captain Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:45.22,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.73,0:16:59.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Once the Garmillas fleet escapes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:17:01.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...Starsha will have Iscandar self-destruct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:07.24,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Couldn't you force her to come ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:11.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That person's resolve…is firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:19.60,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Seriously ?!{Are you alright ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.55,0:17:23.35,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Are you really alright with that ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.11,0:17:54.66,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}{ima mo kokoro ni nokoru itoshii omokage}A lovely image that still remains in my heart\N{\i1}ima mo kokoro ni nokoru itoshī omokage
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:18:05.57,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}{hikaru namida no nakano yasashii hohoemi}A gentle smile shows through shining tears\N{\i1}hikaru namida no naka no yasashī hohoemi{hikaru namida no nakano yasashii hohoemi}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:12.42,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,970)}Farewells are difficult,\Nbut it's very important to have an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:17.60,Karaoke Translation op,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&\3c&H000000&}You have gone on a journey into distant space\N{\i1}haruka uchu no kanata tabidatte itta\N
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.93,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,970)}As long as the memories\N in Sanktel remain intact...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:20.37,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,970)}...we can regenerate our bodies \Nas many times as desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:23.26,Karaoke Translation op,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&\3c&H000000&}You man of love and courage…\N{\i1}ai to yuki no hito yo…\N
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:24.11,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,970)}But such an existence is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:27.40,Karaoke Translation op,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&\3c&H000000&}…I could never forget you, my dear\N{\i1}…wasureenu anata
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:27.73,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\pos(974,968)}You only live once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:39.86,Karaoke Translation op,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&\3c&H000000&}Like white petals called forth by the wind\N{\i1}kaze ni yoba reta shiroi hanabira no yo ni
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:31.20,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,965)}That's why you foster a strong\Nwill to find fulfillment in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:36.84,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{owaru}{\pos(972,965)}A life ends when the time comes. \NThat's what life really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.73,0:18:43.48,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{dakara}{\pos(972,965)}That's why I didn't revive\N Sasha when she died for Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:54.75,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{moshi}{\pos(972,965)}The next time Sasha is reborn,\N I want her to have a brand new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:44.95,Karaoke Translation op,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&\3c&H000000&}Listen and believe in eternal love\N{\i1}towa no ai o shinji kiite
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:51.91,Karaoke Translation op,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&\3c&H000000&}I reach out my hand to you !\N{\i1}te o sashinoberu watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:19:04.44,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{kono}{\pos(972,965)}I was going to give her name to a new life, which has \Ncome into Iscandar for the first time in thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:19:04.44,Karaoke Translation op,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&\3c&H000000&}Is the sky getting dark…? Are you lonely…?\N{\i1}sora wa kuraidesu ka samishīdesu ka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:09.06,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,But now, that won't come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:11.91,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Yurisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:18.46,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,You were hastily created from Sanktel so \Nwe could interact with the people of Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:21.91,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,I don't think you understand\N what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:23.91,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:27.86,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:31.20,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,...I don't, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.31,0:19:37.31,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Let me hold you like this for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:48.62,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}{aoi chikyuu wo anata itsumo wasurenai de}My dear, I will never forget you, or the blue Earth\N{\i1}aoi chikyuu wo anata itsumo wasurenai de
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.55,0:20:01.71,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}{towa no ai wo mune ni himete ikitsuzukemasu watashi }With everlasting love in your heart, I'll live on !\N{\i1}towa no ai wo mune ni himete ikitsuzukemasu watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.40,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\pos(944,928)}Resume transfer of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:08.31,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}{kitto kaerimasune ai aru kagiri}I'm sure I'll return...\N{\i1}kitto kaerimasune
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:13.46,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}{kitto kaerimasune ai aru kagiri}...as long as there's love\N{\i1}ai aru kagiri
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:22.11,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&\fad(0,1000)}{ai aru kagiri}As long as there's love\N{\i1}ai aru kagiri
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:29.05,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Deusula III has reversed course !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.82,0:20:37.80,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:39.95,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.95,0:20:43.77,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,You've lived your life \Nenough for other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.77,0:20:46.86,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,, You can do whatever you\N want for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:20:58.43,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,He can't be...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:00.57,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Desler Cannon, fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:25.75,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Abelt...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.31,0:21:27.53,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Abelt !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.26,0:21:32.55,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Kodai, shoot me !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.17,0:21:36.24,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Only its outer surface is special !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.91,0:21:40.04,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Fire your wave motion gun at my Deusula !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:44.71,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}That'll surely trigger the destruction\Nof this fortress from the inside !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:48.13,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,This is the only way, Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:52.68,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}If we can destroy this fortress...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.68,0:21:57.15,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...Starsha won't need to have\N the planet self-destruct.{have to destroy the planet.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.75,0:22:06.82,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I don't care if she's an illusion or if she's the \Ndevil's pawn, who's toyed with the people of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:09.64,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.48,0:22:12.93,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...love Starsha, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:21.77,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Come about 180 degrees !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.28,0:22:23.35,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.35,0:22:24.48,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Captain Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:28.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the wave motion gun !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.84,0:22:30.35,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The one to pull the trigger…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.35,0:22:31.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...will be me !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:44.70,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\3c&H000000&\pos(458,1061)}Iscandar, the Dying Planet of Sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:44.70,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(210,874)\3c&H000000&}Episode 7
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:51.58,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(972,680)}Hello, Sasha
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:51.58,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(968,466)\3c&H000000&}Next Time
